---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Trade | The Crypto Realm" description="Crypto exchanges to buy from, and a Ledger hardware wallet to keep your own keys.">
  <section class="container page-title">
    <div class="eyebrow">TRADE</div>
    <h1>Where to Buy Crypto</h1>
    <p class="subtle">Exchanges where you can sign up and buy. When you’re ready for full control, move your coins to a wallet that only you hold the keys to.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container section" id="exchanges">
    <div class="disclosure">Some links on this page are referral or affiliate links. If you sign up or buy through them, I may earn a reward or commission at no extra cost to you. Exchanges aren’t available in every country, so check what’s offered where you live. This is not financial advice. Please read the <a href="/disclaimer">disclaimer</a>.</div>
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">EXCHANGES</div><h2>Buy crypto</h2></div></div>
    <div class="exchange-grid"><div class="card exchange"><div class="ex-head"><img class="ex-logo" src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>Coinbase</h3><p>Crypto exchange</p></div></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://coinbase.com/join/TR4QRX8?src=android-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored">SIGN UP ON COINBASE ↗</a></div><div class="card exchange"><div class="ex-head"><img class="ex-logo" src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>Crypto.com</h3><p>Crypto exchange</p></div></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://crypto.com/app/rqfyfc3k2w" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored">SIGN UP ON CRYPTO.COM ↗</a></div><div class="card exchange"><div class="ex-head"><img class="ex-logo" src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>Kraken</h3><p>Crypto exchange</p></div></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://invite.kraken.com/JDNW/z1z9jie3" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored">SIGN UP ON KRAKEN ↗</a></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section" id="wallet">
    <div class="wallet-panel">
      <div class="wallet-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">SELF-CUSTODY</div>
        <h2>Not your keys,<br/><span>not your coins.</span></h2>
        <p class="subtle">Exchanges hold your coins for you. A hardware wallet keeps your keys in your own hands, so no company, bank or platform can freeze or take your funds.</p>
        <div class="ex-head wallet-name"><img class="ex-logo" src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>Ledger Nano X</h3><p>Hardware wallet</p></div></div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://shop.ledger.com/pages/ledger-nano-x?r=0623129b4c5b" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored">GET THE LEDGER NANO X ↗</a>
        <p class="wallet-tip"><strong>Stay safe:</strong> buy only from the official Ledger site or a verified seller, and set the device up yourself. Never share your recovery phrase with anyone, and never type it into a computer or phone.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="wallet-photo" href="https://shop.ledger.com/pages/ledger-nano-x?r=0623129b4c5b" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" aria-label="Get the Ledger Nano X"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Ledger Nano X hardware wallet" width="560" height="441" loading="lazy"/></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .disclosure{border:1px solid #4b3d2a;background:#111b2d;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 20px;color:#aab7ca;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:34px}
  .exchange-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
  .exchange{padding:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;justify-content:space-between}
  .ex-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
  .ex-head h3{margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2}
  .ex-head p{margin:2px 0 0;color:#a9b7c9;font-size:14px}
  .ex-logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;display:block;flex:none}
  .wallet-panel{background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 50%,#6f501a55,transparent 45%),linear-gradient(110deg,#1c2a3d,#0d1422);border:1px solid #4b3d2a;border-radius:20px;padding:48px 60px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
  .wallet-panel h2{font-size:clamp(35px,5vw,58px);line-height:1.05;margin:15px 0}
  .wallet-panel h2 span{color:#f5b638}
  .wallet-copy .subtle{max-width:480px}
  .wallet-name{margin:26px 0 20px}
  .wallet-tip{margin:22px 0 0;max-width:480px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#aab7ca}
  .wallet-tip strong{color:#f5b638}
  .wallet-photo{display:block;justify-self:center;width:100%;max-width:440px;transition:transform .25s ease}
  .wallet-photo img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 22px 60px #000b,0 0 50px #f5b63826}
  .wallet-photo:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}
  .wallet-photo:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #f5b638;outline-offset:6px}
  @media(max-width:850px){.exchange-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wallet-panel{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:30px;gap:28px}}
</style>
